      // 100 to 60). A van leaving the area with the minimum loaded stops them (the clock pauses; back in the area it goes on); on the road to the drop chase cars come instead. One van's crew: 5, 1 melee (an Enforcer: assault_enforcers) and
      // 4 Gunmen (assault_gunmen: more at the top tier) per tier, plus gunmen_per_extra_member Gunmen per extra member in what is left of max_crew (at most 6: the cab's two seats and the bay's four posts), the Enforcers kept first: a bigger
      // squad adds Gunmen, never a second melee member. The van is put down 250 to 400 m of drivable way from the Cartel van and drives to it like a chase car (assault_car). No new Assault while max_assaults_alive of this heist's still
      // fight (a crew member alive or its crew still riding in the van; a standing van with a dead crew does not count, nor a stalled one, see assault_car); a stalled Assault makes the next come right away.
