      // no water; never the road's centre), facing ALONG the van's way there (not towards the van: it needs no U-turn), at least spawn_player_min_m from every player, spawn_apart_m from the other chase cars, clear of vehicles and with a way from it to the van; NO sight rule (the party may see it
      // stand). It WAITS (state Waiting, standing, its Gunmen shooting from the windows within shoot_range_m) until the van has driven past it (it lies behind the van along the van's heading), then follows; at most wait_max_seconds (40), or the van more than give_up_m away for give_up_seconds, then
      // it drives on anyway; the stop rule (below) applies while it waits. A car already chasing that the van comes at head-on (the van faster than stop_speed_mps, within meet_m (70), the headings more than 120 degrees apart, the van ahead of its nose: an Assault van driving in along the road
